# Raw experiment output is large and regenerable; committed summaries live beside it.
# Deliberately NOT ignored, though generated: experiments/figures/*.png,
# experiments/results/*.parquet and web/public/data/*.json. They were ignored, and the
# result was an artifact that did not work when cloned - `make reproduce` reads Parquet and
# none was published, and the dashboard fetches data/demo.json and rendered "Could not load
# results". A project whose contribution claim is "reproducible artifact" has to reproduce
# from a clean clone. The Parquet is 4.5 MB, smaller than the CSVs already committed.
